  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Staff Selection Commission, SSC</a> </span>has released the marks and final answer key for the post of Constable Driver on the official website of SSC. This recruitment was released for 660 posts. Applications for the Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025 were accepted from September 22, 2025, to October 31, 2025. The CBT examination was held on 16-17 December 2025. Candidates <span data-teams=\"true\">who appeared for this examination</span> can download their Delhi Police Constable Driver Marks &amp; Final Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Delhi Police Constable Driver Marks 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>15 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>16 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Correction Date : <strong>31 October 2025 to 02 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>16-17 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Self Slot Selection : <strong>05 December 2025 to 10 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>15 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>31 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result : <strong>29 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Answer Key &amp; Marks : <strong>26 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 660</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.4315%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.4315%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Constable Driver</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">351</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">73</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">170</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">87</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">56</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Passed Class 12th (Intermediate) Exam form any recognized board with Valid Heavy Motor Vehicle (HMV) Driving License will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Should be able to drive heavy vehicles with confidence &amp; Possess knowledge of maintenance of vehicles.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025 : Physical Measurement Test</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Measurement</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Male</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Height</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7804%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">170 cms (relaxable by 5 cm for ST, residents of Hill areas &amp; sons of serving, retired or deceased Delhi Police personnel/ Multi-Tasking Staff of Delhi Police)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chest</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7804%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">81 – 85 cms (relaxable by 5 cm for ST, residents of Hill areas &amp; sons of serving, retired or deceased Delhi Police personnel/ Multi-Tasking Staff of Delhi Police)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Race 1600 M</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Long Jump</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>High Jump</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Up to 30 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">07 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">12.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">3.6 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">30-40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">11.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">3.3 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Above 40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">10.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">03 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Delhi Police Constable Driver Marks &amp; Final Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Marks &amp; Final Answer Key link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the marks &amp; final answer key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download their marks &amp; final answer key download from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Delhi Police Constable Driver Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET &amp; PMT Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Driving Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\